<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT ANDERSEN CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT ANDERSEN CONSULTING WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>KOHLER, Wisconsin 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores at the</p>
<p>international regional of the Andersen Consulting World</p>
<p>Championship of Golf, played under matchplay rules at</p>
<p>Blackwolf Run River Course (par 72, 6,991 yards) on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix numbers denote seedings):</p>
<p>1-Greg Norman (Australia) beat 8-Robert Allenby (Australia),</p>
<p>2-up</p>
<p>2-Ernie Els (South Africa) beat 7-Frank Nobilo (New Zealand),</p>
<p>1-up</p>
<p>3-Nick Price (Zimbabwe) beat 6-Vijay Singh (Fiji), 1-up</p>
<p>4-Steve Elkington (Australia) beat 5-Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe),</p>
<p>1-up</p>
<p>Tuesday's matches</p>
<p>Semifinals: Norman-Elkington, Els-Price, followed by</p>
<p>championship between semifinal winners</p>
</text>
